descriptions.job-0gc73ie:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders is looking for experienced Software Engineers to join our growing Development team in Amsterdam. This is a unique opportunity to work at a leading proprietary trading firm where entrepreneurship, innovation, and technology are at the heart of everything we do. We value sharp, creative thinkers and give them the freedom and responsibility to make a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer at Flow Traders, you will build the systems that power our global trading business and help us compete on exchanges around the world. The work is varied and challenging, ranging from systems operating on or near the critical path, such as receiving market data and placing orders, to platforms that process vast amounts of data with exceptional reliability, performance, and traceability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a key role in advancing our proprietary trading platform by developing efficient, high-performance software, designing innovative solutions, and strengthening existing systems with a focus on low latency and stability. Since markets never stand still, we work in small, business-aligned teams and use agile practices to respond quickly to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Trading every day, creating fast feedback loops and a clear view of the value your work delivers. To support collaboration and encourage autonomy, we build and maintain shared libraries, promote code reuse, and continuously refine our approach to application architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you will do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer and evolve a high-performance, distributed trading platform leveraging modern technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with quants, traders, and business stakeholders to transform complex requirements into innovative, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and inspire junior engineers, fostering technical growth, collaboration, and engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation by evaluating emerging technologies and industry trends, driving impactful improvements across the technology stack, and integrating third-party tools and platforms into our systems where they add value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own software quality from end to end by contributing to code reviews, testing, deployment, and adoption, delivering robust, reliable solutions to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous working experience in professional software development working with a strongly typed language like C++, Java, Rust and ability to be productive in any language leveraging AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of algorithms and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work in a fast-paced, collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of teamwork and ownership and willingness to learn new skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in using LLM augmented development and rapid prototyping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable participating in on-call operations rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc or MSc in Computing Science, Mathematics or other quantitative fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka, Chronicle Queue, gRPC, Google Cloud Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker, Kubernetes, Helm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in the Trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we offer&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flow Traders, we create the conditions for hard‑working, high‑performing people to do their best work. From a thorough onboarding and ongoing access to Flow Academy, to latest technology and a collaborative, non‑hierarchical culture, we give you the tools, ownership, and support to move fast and drive outcomes. We keep a close‑knit, small‑company feel while offering competitive salary, annual discretionary profit share, and comprehensive benefits,&amp;nbsp;so talent can grow here, and stay here.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;See our benefits below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flow Academy and opportunities to attend domain-related conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunch, great coffee, and a fully stocked kitchen and snack bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house Bar and Lounge with arcade, table tennis, billiards, and game consoles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company boat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house gym and sessions with our nutritionist or personal trainer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-weekly massages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company trip and a variety of events throughout the year, such as the New Years Event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global rotations across our offices worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flow Traders does not accept unsolicited resumes from any professional staffing or search firms. All resumes, and any other information identifying potential candidates, submitted to any employee at Flow Traders via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid and signed search agreement will be deemed free to contact by Flow Traders without any restrictions and no placement fee of any kind will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Flow Traders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0bhp492:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;VXZ5d4Y8OoLp9VxVFNCuutA7sOM&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusVhIR7PnRi44GewfuXeUvHc&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusjAubUIBTchLXZZplt9RQyb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct Know Your Business (KYB) reviews for corporate onboarding, including verification of corporate structures, Ultimate Beneficial Ownership (UBO) identification, and document authentication.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusC8ltZfldfpgmNzys3fy0ib&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Perform Enhanced Due Diligence (EDD) on high-risk entities, complex corporate structures, and customers operating in regulated or sensitive industries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusjvCE8O96mGSCSPNFLk6psg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assess PEP exposure, sanctions risk, and adverse media across corporate hierarchies and associated individuals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusNzcGYhxKKJJT6JGqs84kJh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execute ongoing monitoring and periodic reviews of existing corporate clients, ensuring continued compliance with risk appetite and regulatory requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusbSPmOWccJvEPAU1ry8DyEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify and escalate unusual corporate structures, nominee arrangements, shell entities, and other indicators of potential financial crime.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusHh75e4JUb6hiBwAWfjM92f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain accurate and well-documented case files that clearly support risk decisions and meet audit and regulatory standards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusD3sQog9Sa1ZwGLOcuU1DRe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with AML Operations, Compliance, and business teams to resolve complex onboarding cases and provide risk-based recommendations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusTVsolHE5wmfLu1CYCjnZkc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to the development and refinement of KYB procedures, risk frameworks, and assessment criteria.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusXNq4F8ofBcqtkuWQvF0jih&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3uEsir2CpQXzeYZIFppOZd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2+ years of experience in KYB, KYC/CDD, corporate due diligence, or financial crime compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusY66wCnYe2uGkAkctWCDt0g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of corporate structures, ownership chains, UBO identification, and entity verification across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusjogwzeMYgoqbRsZuXCy2pe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated experience handling complex, high-risk, or regulated customers, including financial institutions, MSBs, funds, and trust structures.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusWr4cUQcOAlFAY2DLuFfkDb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with AML/CFT regulations, sanctions regimes, and beneficial ownership transparency requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus97ApwRxkLACJmuWQC5n9Ab&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with cryptocurrency-related entities (exchanges, custodians, DeFi protocols) is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBdHwXTztHPcNrMdzwLILpd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical and research skills with excellent attention to detail and sound risk judgement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7rfoYIDupUh9wvLq4pYCAf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Professional certifications such as CAMS, ICA, or equivalent are advantageous.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus6AA9JyeiDusTlDbT2op4Fe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Embraces AI and emerging technologies to improve productivity and streamline compliance processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxuspt8nLkLlCpWTVtTDyeJ6tf&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusDXliJQxpwawAQ4v49e1Q3d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable navigating complex corporate records across multiple jurisdictions and piecing together a clear picture from diverse sources.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxT5NRI3hxpUpsZIuzCducg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High integrity with the confidence to challenge incomplete information and maintain independent risk judgement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus1sTQRFmyt6Zjh8Lf9ajZgb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, high-growth environment with evolving regulatory expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusq4VbD0plF3ukeHZ1mRFdFc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong communicator who can articulate risk clearly and concisely to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-09ryfba:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hut 8 is building large-scale energy and digital infrastructure, including data center campuses with capital budgets in excess of $500 million per project. We are seeking a Principal, Project Controls to serve as the cost, schedule, and financial conscience of our construction program. Embedded within project teams, this role owns project estimating, budgeting, forecasting, and cost reporting across active developments, and acts as the connective tissue between field execution and corporate finance (FP&amp;amp;A), Treasury, and Strategic Finance.&lt;br&gt;This is a high-visibility position: you will prepare and deliver weekly reporting to executive leadership, and you must be comfortable challenging project managers, general contractors, and vendors when the numbers, schedule, or scope don&#39;t hold up. Independence, sound judgment, and full transparency in escalating problems are essential to success in this role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Project Controls &amp;amp; Estimating&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own project controls across assigned capital projects ($100M+): budgets, cost tracking, forecasting (EAC/ETC), change management, contingency management, and cash flow projections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and pressure-test project estimates at each stage gate — from conceptual and feasibility estimates through GMP validation and buyout — and reconcile estimates against actuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor contractor schedules and cost reports; perform variance analysis on cost and schedule and drive corrective action with the project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review pay applications, change orders, and invoices for accuracy, contract compliance, and alignment to budget before approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Construction Finance &amp;amp; FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with corporate FP&amp;amp;A and Accounting on capital planning, accruals, monthly close support, and reconciliation of project costs between PMIS and ERP systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain project-level financial models supporting capital commitments, funding draws, and reforecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of annual and multi-year capital budgets for the construction portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Executive Communication&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present weekly project status and cost reports to the C-suite; deliver monthly portfolio-level reporting covering budget health, forecast movement, risks, and key decisions required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and credibly with executives — distilling complex project data into concise, decision-ready reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain consistent weekly and monthly reporting cadences, templates, and KPIs across projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Risk, Escalation &amp;amp; Site Presence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and flag cost, schedule, scope, and commercial issues — with a full-escalation mindset: no surprises to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push back constructively on project managers, contractors, and vendors when forecasts, change orders, or schedules are not supportable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to active project sites (25%+ of time, self-managed cadence) to validate progress, verify percent-complete against billings, and stay connected to field realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–7+ years of experience in project controls, cost engineering, construction finance, or FP&amp;amp;A supporting large capital construction projects; data center, mission-critical, energy, or heavy industrial experience strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience on projects of $500M+ total installed cost, working embedded with project delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to challenge and influence project managers, contractors, and senior stakeholders with data-driven analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including experience reporting to executive or C-suite audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Construction Management, Engineering, Finance, Accounting, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel 25%+ to project sites across North America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMIS: Hands-on experience with project management information systems (e.g., Procore, Kahua, e-Builder, Unifier, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ERP: NetSuite strongly preferred; experience with QuickBooks or comparable ERP/accounting platforms acceptable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel: Advanced proficiency — complex models, pivot tables, lookups; Power BI or similar dashboarding a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduling: Working familiarity with Primavera P6 and/or MS Project a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is&amp;nbsp;in office at our corporate headquarters in the Brickell area of Miami, Florida. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0h03sp2:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Employee &amp;amp; Workplace Experience (EWX) team within People Success, the team responsible for creating and enhancing the places and programs that define Coinbase culture. As an EWX Intern, you&#39;ll own an initiative that improves and/or informs how we design, measure, and scale employee experiences across remote and in-person environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program analytics &amp;amp; measurement&lt;/strong&gt;: Build or improve dashboards that track program effectiveness, engagement, and ROI across EWX initiatives. Surface insights that help the team make faster, better decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted operations&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify manual, repetitive workflows and design AI-powered solutions to automate or streamline them. This could include intake automation, reporting pipelines, or intelligent routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program design &amp;amp; iteration&lt;/strong&gt;: Analyze participation data, employee feedback, and outcome signals to recommend improvements to existing programs or design new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational systems improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with internal platforms to improve data quality, user experience, or reporting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change management &amp;amp; communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Support change management strategies and stakeholder communications to ensure smooth adoption of new processes and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Data Science, Business Analytics, Operations Management, Industrial/Organizational Psychology, or a related field with demonstrated coursework or projects in process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Workspace with working familiarity with at least one project management or process mapping tool (e.g., Asana, Jira, Lucidchart)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collect, analyze, and present data to inform operational decisions (e.g., through coursework, prior internships, or personal projects)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using generative AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) to draft content, automate workflows, or prototype solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
